  redistributed under GPL-3.0.
- **Natural Earth**, public domain. Source of the generated coastline in
  `src/data/geo/land-path.ts`, via the `world-atlas` package.
  https://www.naturalearthdata.com/

The atlas draws schematic extents, not surveyed borders. See `/methodology` for
the policy.

